  "content": "\n\n<p>本模組是 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fslashblade-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SlashBlade-Refabricated</a> 的擴充模組包，新增了 SlashBlade、SE 等內容，並收錄了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fslashblade-resharped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SlashBlade-Resharped</a> 的部分擴充模組，詳細資訊可參考原始擴充模組。</p>\n<p>目前收錄：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sjap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">日式擴充模組包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cialloblade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CialloBlade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenergyblade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EnergyBlade（HF Blade）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yakumoblade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YakumoBlade</a></li>\n<li>更多擴充即將推出…</li>\n</ul>",
